# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# A press on a desktop icon is seen while the button is down: the icon
# goes dark under the hand, and lifts to its selected wash on release.
wait 12
key w ctrl
wait 6
note the note's paper, unselected, is its own pale yellow
expect-pixel 170 30 fff3ae
press 170 38
wait 2
note held: dark under the button
expect-pixel 170 30 8c855f
release 170 38
wait 2
note let go: the selection wash, lighter than the hold
expect-pixel 170 30 a8a072
quit
